              have all finite limits. To conclude, it is now sufficient to observe that this construction descends to sheaf toposes as claimed.
            %p
              To that end, just to note that for a geometric morphism
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
